OL,3,AEthiopia's army says it has repelled
OL,4,Aattacks in first comment on fresh
OL,5,Afighting
OL,6,
OL,7,FEthiopia's army says it has repelled
OL,8,Fattacks from Tigrayan forces and their
OL,9,Fallies in parts of the north of the
OL,10,Fcountry, in its first statement since
OL,11,Ffighting broke out on Wednesday.
OL,13,FThe army said hostilities began in an
OL,14,Farea of Amhara region close to the
OL,15,Fborder with Tigray, adding that its
OL,16,Fsoldiers had inflicted heavy casualties
OL,17,Fand seized weapons.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
